    <tags>cypher-contacts contacts address-book vcard csv export import backup offline</tags>
    <summary>Exports your address book eleven ways and imports it back, on your own device.</summary>
    <description>Most phones will happily show you your contacts and then fight you when you try to take them somewhere else. Cypher Contacts is built around the opposite idea: browse and edit normally, then export the whole address book into whatever format the next tool actually reads — and import it back the same way.</description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/kencypher56/cypher-releases/releases/tag/cypher-contacts-v1.18</releaseNotes>
